Package: vrtstack
Title: Create GDAL Multidimensional VRTs from 2D Raster Collections
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2471-7511"))
Description: Stack 2D rasters (COGs, GeoTIFFs, etc.) along a new dimension,
    producing GDAL Multidimensional VRT files. This enables treating a 
    collection of 2D rasters as a single multidimensional array, readable 
    by GDAL's multidim API, xarray backends (gdx, xgdal), and other tools.
    Supports regular axes (start + increment), explicit values, and 
    automatic extraction of dimension values from filenames using regex
    patterns with optional date/time parsing.
